Value Required TRANSMITTED (\d+)
Value Required RECEIVED (\d+)
Value Required LOSS_PERCENT ([\d\.]+)
Value MIN_RTT ([\d\.]+)
Value AVG_RTT ([\d\.]+)
Value MAX_RTT ([\d\.]+)

Start
  ^${TRANSMITTED} packets transmitted, ${RECEIVED} (?:packets )?received, ${LOSS_PERCENT}%\s*(?:packet )?loss
  ^(?:round-trip|rtt) min/avg/max(?:/mdev)?\s*=\s*${MIN_RTT}/${AVG_RTT}/${MAX_RTT}